      "content": "thanks. can u do another one? maybe a different patient so we can compare how to handle different types of people? like someone who might be more difficult to manage or has a different background so the students see how to adjust their approach. maybe a caucasian patient this time with a similar injury so we can see if the protocol changes at all.",
